<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Razor">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Version>0.5.1-preview9</Version>
    <AssemblyName>Senparc.Xncf.MCP</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Senparc.Xncf.MCP</RootNamespace>
    <GenerateEmbeddedFilesManifest>true</GenerateEmbeddedFilesManifest>
    <AddRazorSupportForMvc>true</AddRazorSupportForMvc>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild Condition=" '$(Configuration)' == 'Release' ">true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Description>Model Context Protocol(MCP) Manager</Description>
    <Copyright>Senparc</Copyright>
    <PackageTags>Senparc,NeuCharFramework,NCF,Senparc.Xncf.MCP</PackageTags>
    <Authors>Senparc</Authors>
    <Owners>Senparc</Owners>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Title>MCP Manager</Title>
    <!--<ProjectUrl>https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NCF</ProjectUrl>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NcfPackageSources</PackageProjectUrl>-->
    <PackageIcon>icon.jpg</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
      v0.1.0 创世
      v0.2.0 Update new ModelContextProtocol library
      [2025-06-20] v0.2.1-beta Add MCP functions in XncfRegisterBase class
      [2025-06-20] v0.2.2-beta Add MCP functions in XncfRegisterBase class
      [2025-06-28] v0.2.3-preview.1 Add MCP server selection in MyFunction_MCPCallRequest
      [2025-11-01] update basic libraries, including Senparc.AI
      [2026-04-24] Simplify FunctionRender request parameters and keep SelectionList UI metadata compatibility
      [2026-07-02] v0.3.2-preview1 支持流式输出并优化交互体验，升级 Senparc.AI.AgentKernel 并完成兼容性适配
      1、支持流式输出并优化交互体验
      2、升级 Senparc.AI.AgentKernel 并完成兼容性适配
      [2026-07-07] v0.3.3-preview2 Dependency updates from upstream modules
      1、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AIKernel to 0.13.5-preview4
      2、升级 Senparc.AI 至 0.27.3、Senparc.AI.AgentKernel 至 0.1.10
      [2026-07-16] v0.3.3.1-preview3 remove .placeholder file in wwwroot folder
      [2026-07-17] v0.4.0-preview3 为 MCP 模块接入统一资源本地化并优化功能文案
      1、接入统一资源本地化机制，支持模块功能文案按当前文化动态显示
      2、更新 FunctionRender 与请求模型文案的资源化解析
      3、统一模块注册信息、菜单名称与功能描述的本地化输出
      4、同步管理页面与前端交互文案的多语言显示
      5、同步 AIKernel 0.14.0-preview5 的 NeuChar 模型 API 版本适配
      [2026-07-29] v0.4.1-preview4 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.22.0-preview3
      [2026-07-31] v0.4.2-preview5 升级 MCP 模块的 AI 与 CO2NET 兼容依赖
      1、升级 Senparc.AI 组件版本以适配 CO2NET 4.2.0 二进制接口
      2、升级 Senparc.CO2NET.WebApi 至 2.1.9-preview
      [2026-08-04] v0.4.3-preview6 Dependency updates from upstream projects
      1、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.1-preview5
      2、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant to 0.21.5-preview5
      3、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Service to 0.23.5-preview5
      4、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AIKernel to 0.15.1-preview8
      5、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.SenMapic to 0.4.1-preview5
      6、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.3-preview5
      [2026-08-08] v0.4.4-preview7 Dependency updates from upstream projects
      1、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.2-preview6
      2、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant to 0.21.6-preview6
      3、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Service to 0.23.6-preview6
      4、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AIKernel to 0.15.2-preview9
      5、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.SenMapic to 0.4.2-preview6
      6、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.4-preview6
      [2026-08-13] v0.5.0-preview8 补充 A2A 发布管理所需 MCP 功能与多语言资源
      1、扩展发布智能体相关 MCP 应用服务能力
      2、补齐多语言资源，保持管理端功能文案一致
      [2026-08-15] v0.5.1-preview9 Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AIKernel to 0.15.3-preview12
      1、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AIKernel to 0.15.4-preview13
</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NcfPackageSources</RepositoryUrl>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;Test;TemplateRelease</Configurations>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition=" '$(Configuration)' == 'Release' ">
    <OutputPath>..\..\BuildOutPut</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.AI" Version="10.5.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.FileProviders.Embedded" Version="10.0.2" />
    <EmbeddedResource Include="wwwroot\**\*" />
    <PackageReference Include="Senparc.CO2NET.WebApi" Version="2.1.9-preview" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Basic\Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase\Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Basic\Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant\Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Basic\Senparc.Ncf.Service\Senparc.Ncf.Service.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Senparc.Xncf.AIKernel\Senparc.Xncf.AIKernel.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Senparc.Xncf.SenMapic\Senparc.Xncf.SenMapic.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\System\Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase\[5955]Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase.csproj" />
    <None Include="App_Data\SenparcTraceLog\*" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\icon.jpg" Pack="true" Visible="false" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Remove="App_Data\Database\SenparcConfig.config" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="App_Data\Database\SenparcConfig.config" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <Import Project="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\..\Senparc.AI.AgentKernel.props" />
</Project>
